	<div style="background-color:;display:block !important;" class="p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:24:15">
<div style="flex:1" className={styles.pvlColumn} class="column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:24:15-1:1 Column:0">
<div style="background-color:#2A313F;color:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:8"><h1 style="text-align: center;">It Takes An Army</h1></div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:3:21"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:4:10">
	Wake County is a wonderful place to live, work, and raise a family. Consistently ranked among the nation’s “Best Places for Business and Careers,” our community is thriving with growth and prosperity visible around nearly every corner.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:5:43">
	But not everyone shares in that success.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:6:6">
	Every day, thousands of our neighbors — men, women, and children — face unimaginable challenges. They’re battling hunger. Struggling with mental illness. Fighting to break free from the grip of human trafficking. And as our population grows, so too does the need. A&nbsp;need that is quickly outpacing available resources.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:7:86">Since 1887, <b>The Salvation Army of Wake County</b> has stood beside those in greatest need.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:8:35">We provide:</p>
<ul data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:9:61">
	<li><span style="tab-stops:list .5in;">Shelter for the homeless</span></li>
	<li><span style="tab-stops:list .5in;">Disaster relief for families in crisis</span></li>
	<li><span style="tab-stops:list .5in;">Hot meals and food support for the hungry</span></li>
	<li><span style="tab-stops:list .5in;">Pathways to freedom for victims of human trafficking</span></li>
	<li><span style="tab-stops:list .5in;">Holiday hope for over 7,000 children annually through our Angel Tree program</span></li>
</ul>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:10:93"></div>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:11:98">It takes <b>an Army</b> to meet these needs.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:12:24">It takes <strong>volunteers</strong> who give their time.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:13:40">It takes <strong>community</strong> partners who care.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:14:72">And it takes <b>donors like you</b>, turning compassion into action.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:15:81"><b>Join Our Army. Become a Shield Sustainer Today.</b></p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:16:93">
	Your gift helps lift those in in need offering them not just assistance, but a fighting chance at a better life.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:17:83">Together, we can make a difference.</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:18:34"><b>Please give today and help us help our neighbors in need across Wake County.</b></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>